WEBVTT

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.750
Are you okay?

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:51.100
<i>When I woke from my deep slumber...</i>

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.300
Hey...

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:59.700
<i>The first thing I saw...</i>

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:06.280
<i>was a boy with an uneasy 
expression staring down at me.</i>

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.240
Hey, are you okay?

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.500
Who are you?

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.230
I'm... I'm Suigin.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:20.830
Suigin...

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.970
Yeah! Riku Suigin!

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:27.440
What's your name?

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.180
I'm...

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:40.600
Suigin Gets Closer to Riku Rei!

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:45.390
The fireflies are so pretty.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:48.010
Yeah... But...

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:50.460
Isn't it a bit creepy?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.730
Shinryou Academy

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.340
Why are we out here?

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:54.320
The Cemetery
Adjacent to the Academy

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.030
Because this is a great spot 
that no one knows about.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.990
Great spot?

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.760
More importantly, come on.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.410
H-Hey!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.500
What?

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.530
It's okay, isn't it?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.420
Right, right?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.950
H-Hey, no! No, don't!

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.960
What's wrong?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.140
Hello...

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.430
Aw, they left.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.350
And they left a mess again.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.090
There.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.630
Still, being the security guard here

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.040
is a rather ideal job, as long 
as no riffraff comes in.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:53.100
I mean, it's cool at night, and I'm allowed 
to use their electricity as much as I'd like.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.410
Well, then... Guess I'll get 
started for the night.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.230
Wh-Whoa!

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.220
He beat the Ultimate Dragon in a second.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.650
And with that lame equipment?

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.160
You guys haven't heard of him?

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:33.920
A mysterious lone wolf that doesn't speak.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.590
The no-charge meister who came from nowhere

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:41.470
that defeats enemies with the 
lowest grade equipment... Gin!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.430
Just kidding.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:50.130
Oh, I just leveled up again.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:55.400
Well, I mean, it's just because I spend 
every night, when I have free time, playing...

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.390
Let's see... the next dungeon is...

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.530
<i>Help me!</i>

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.360
What?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.160
No!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.570
Why, you...

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.540
<i>It had no effect!</i>

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.000
Aw...

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:20.340
<i>No! Someone save me!</i>

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.340
Using a water attack on 
a Kickbacker is taboo.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:21.800
For these guys...

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:28.890
You use ice...

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.330
and physical strikes!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.240
Um...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.040
Thanks.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.610
I...

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:51.110
Thank you for saving me from that tight spot.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:57.080
Um, I'm Rei. What's your name?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:58.910
Huh?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.500
Huh?!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.180
W-Wait, wait, wait!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.170
Oh, come on!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.140
The only thing that I can think of...

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.640
is that...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.690
I'll be fine, Wanchoi.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.710
All I need to do is connect this, and...

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:28.290
And, like... He was super amazing!

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:33.810
That was such a strong boss character 
and he beat it like it was nothing...

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:59.780
You lecher!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.770
Idiot! Perv! Peeping tom!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.480
Super pervert!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.410
High School Building

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.990
Ow...

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:21.830
They just immediately treated 
me like some peeping tom...

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.590
Though I guess it can't be 
helped in that situation.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.880
You're playing that again?

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:29.710
You must really like that.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.880
Yes. It's a game that my father made.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.420
I see.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.600
Well, you do really love 
your father, Riku Rei.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.740
Yeah! And...

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:41.760
I feel like...

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:46.990
the game is where I really 
belong, rather than reality.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:52.660
Really belong, huh? You aren't 
very good, considering that.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.550
Maki, you're so mean!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.780
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:56.580
Jeez.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.290
If it's hidden, it's a flower.

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:02.170
R-Ranshou?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.680
Falling in love is, of, course all right.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:07.600
But...

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.550
Just remember this.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:14.220
She's considered an idol, among 
the boys at the academy.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.720
If you fall in love with a star in the sky,

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.730
Come on, Riku Rei-chan.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.230
that's even higher than 
the highest flower...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.380
I'll treat you.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.730
Are you sure you're not 
just going to get burned?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.310
You're so annoying! Let's go.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.490
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:28.610
Wait up!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.330
Riku Rei-chan!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.990
Is the Riku Rei you were talking about...

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.700
Oh...

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:40.010
Jeez. Saying whatever you want... 
It's not like that.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:41.680
I...

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.290
I just...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.540
That's right.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.350
I just enjoy the fact...

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.060
Boys' Dormitory

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:07.190
that I keep getting stronger in the game.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.970
<i>Hello, Gin-san.</i>

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:16.660
<i>Thank you for saving me when I 
was in danger the other day.</i>

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.120
<i>Please be my friend.</i>

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.470
<i>Please.</i>

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.000
Seriously?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.980
<i>The next several months...</i>

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:43.300
<i>The time that her and I were 
together seemed like a dream.</i>

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.890
<i>I really don't need anything else, other than 
the time I get to spend with you in the game.</i>

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.900
<i>That's what I truly thought.</i>

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:53.510
<i>But...</i>

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.310
Hey, Gin-san.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.310
I wonder what you're like 
outside of the game.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:10.240
I would love to meet the real you someday.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.330
<i>Of course, we could never meet.</i>

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.860
<i>Because in the real world, 
I'm swamped with my part-time jobs.</i>

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.810
<i>I'm just a poor student with no family.</i>

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.000
<i>You and I live in completely 
different worlds,</i>

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>and are of completely 
different social statuses.</i>

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:43.520
It's true! Really!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.960
<i>So...</i>

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.330
<i>Just when we're inside the game together...</i>

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.540
<i>I was hoping that maybe</i>

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.590
<i>I could just stare at you forever...</i>

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.020
<i>The only thing that I ask for...</i>

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.930
<i>is for our time together 
to continue on forever.</i>

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.600
<i>That's all I wanted.</i>

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.450
Important Announcement

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.370
Huh?

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:23.120
The distribution of this game will be ending

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:22.770
Distribution... Ending...

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.400
What?!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Regrets the End!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.910
The Silver Guardian!
